      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This could also be used to make portal drop zones, simply have a box collider that sets portals to allowed when they're in the box and disallowed otherwise. This would be super handy for dance clubs (portals allowed in the lobby but not on the dance floor) and anywhere else where portals need to be location-specific.",
