  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-17T04:22:45.085Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are many applications for temporary portal-drop restrictions, as portal dropping can be disruptive:  portals allowed in game lobby only, during events, to prevent path-blocking or using portals to visually obscure things, etc.  Currently the only toggle available is during world upload.\nAt the moment, Udon can restrict portal drops by placing a spawn transform at the player position.  (I was almost ready to release a toggle prefab that uses this method.)\nWith the upcoming portal placement feature, this workaround will likely no longer be possible.  \nPlease make the \"allow portals\" to be an udon-exposed feature.",
